 = false (LEVELS_DISABLED), else this club's levels (NOT_FOUND). expectedUntil: the last club-local day the setup is shown, today or later (VALIDATION_ERROR). expiresAt = the earlier of the start of the day after expectedUntil and the start of the day courses.setupAutoExpireDays after today, in the club's time zone. The ring's active setup, if any, becomes DISMANTLED (replacedSetupId) in the same transaction and Ring.activeSetupId names the new one; a concurrent registration on the ring → STALE_VERSION. Publishes RingSetupChanged{ACTIVE} (N-31 when messaging.notifyNewRingSetup and kind ≠ EMPTY) and audits RING_SETUP_REGISTERED.","operationId":"createRingSetup","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RingSetupRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"S16 RingSetupCreated","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RingSetupCreated"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY, PLACEMENT_RING_MISMATCH, SETUP_SOURCE_REQUIRED, LEVELS_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schema