d}. Schema violations return 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details.fieldErrors[{field, code}]; nested fields use paths such as modules[2] or paymentProviders.SEPA_XML.creditorId, an unknown property names itself (e.g. accounts), and codes are REQUIRED or INVALID_VALUE.","operationId":"createPlatformClub","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ClubDefinition"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"PlatformClubCreated","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlatformClubCreated"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"SLUG_TAKEN, HOST_ALREADY_USED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"MODULE_DEPENDENCY, HOST_RESERVED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/platform/clubs/{id}/theme/upload-url":{"post":{"tags":["platform"],"summary":"uploadPlatformLogo","description":"S17 §2/§6, R-17-02. Roles: AGILITYHUB_ADMIN, without a tenant or club membership. The console's only logo upload (light logo, dark logo or mark): an image upload bound to the target club and caller, with the attachment route's signed-upload response and five-minute expiry. mimeType must be an image allowed by the target club's files.allowedTypes and sizeBytes must not exceed files.maxSizeMb (FILE_TOO_LARGE includes maxSizeMb). Upload with the returned headers, then publish the fileKey with the versioned theme update (logoFileKey, logoDarkFileKey or markFileKey).","operationId":"uploadPlatformLogo","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlatformLogoUploadRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Signed upload URL and opaque file key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Upload"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, FILE_TOO_LARGE, FILE_TYPE_NOT_ALLOWED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"CLUB_NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/platform/clubs/{id}/support-access":{"post":{"tags":["platform"],"summary":"startSupportAccess","description":"S17 R-17-10. Roles: AGILITYHUB_ADMIN. Global, no tenant or module required. A SUPPORT grant of platform.supportAccessMinutes (60) and its token: a clubs-admin access token (no refresh token) with the club's clubId, roles [ADMIN], actorAccountId and sub = the calling platform account, support = true and no platformRoles. Every request with it re-checks the grant: once it expires, is ended with POST /oauth2/revoke, or its account is no longer an active AGILITYHUB_ADMIN, the token is 401 UNAUTHENTICATED. It never reaches the personal-data exports and their files, the SEPA files (full IBANs), a member impersonation or the account's own credentials and sessions: 403 SUPPORT_RESTRICTED; IBANs stay masked elsewhere. GET /me answers it with an ADMIN membership and support {actorName, expiresAt}. Audited SUPPORT_ACCESS_STARTED {reason, details.expiresAt} in the club's own audit, and every action taken with it is audited with origin = PLATFORM_SUPPORT; publishes SupportAccessStarted. A replay of the same key answers the same token.","operationId":"startSupportAccess","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SupportAccessRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"SupportAccess","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SupportAccess"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"CLUB_NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/platform/clubs/{id}/public-api-key":{"post":{"tags":["platform"],"summary":"rotatePublicApiKey","description":"S17 R-17-11. Roles: AGILITYHUB_ADMIN. Global, no tenant or module required. Generates the club's website key (agh_pub_ + 43 URL-safe characters) and answers it once; only its SHA-256 digest is stored. The key it replaces keeps opening the X-Api-Key public routes (S05/S07) for 24 hours, then answers 403 INVALID_API_KEY; a second rotation inside those 24 hours ends the older key at once. A replay of the same Idempotency-Key answers the same key (stored sealed). Audited PUBLIC_API_KEY_ROTATED without any key value; publishes ClubUpdated.","operationId":"rotatePublicApiKey","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"201":{"description":"PublicApiKey","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PublicApiKey"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"CLUB_NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5