er Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/platform/clubs/{id}/domains":{"post":{"tags":["platform"],"summary":"addPlatformDomain","description":"S17 R-17-02/R-17-03. Roles: AGILITYHUB_ADMIN. Global, no tenant or module required. The host is normalized (lower case, IDN to ASCII, no final dot or port); it is unique among every club and app (409 HOST_ALREADY_USED) and the product hosts clubs.*, clubsadmin.*, id.* and core.* are reserved (422 HOST_RESERVED). A template club has no domains: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR {field: template}. The new domain is PENDING, not primary, with its DNS instructions in verification; GET /branding with it answers 404 UNKNOWN_HOST until it is verified. Audited CLUB_DOMAIN_CHANGED; publishes ClubUpdated.","operationId":"addPlatformDomain","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlatformDomainRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"PlatformDomain","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlatformDomain"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"CLUB_NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"HOST_ALREADY_USED, STALE_VERSION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"HOST_RESERVED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/platform/clubs/{id}/domains/{host}/verification":{"post":{"tags":["platform"],"summary":"verifyPlatformDomain","description":"S17 R-17-03. Roles: AGILITYHUB_ADMIN. Global, no tenant or module required. Looks up (a) a CNAME from the host to verification.cnameTarget, else (b) the TXT record verification.recordName = verification.recordValue. Found: the domain is VERIFIED (verifiedAt, the challenge removed), the primary one of its app when the app has no verified primary yet, Caddy's ask (GET /internal/domains/allowed) accepts it and GET /branding resolves it; publishes ClubDomainVerified and ClubUpdated, audited CLUB_DOMAIN_CHANGED. Not found: 422 HOST_NOT_VERIFIED {host, cnameTarget, recordName, recordValue} (the records it expects; the TXT pair is null without a challenge), nothing changes and the key is released, so a retry checks again. A VERIFIED domain answers 409 INVALID_STATE {status}. A BROKEN domain (S15 P9's re-check failed three times in a row) also passes when the host shares an address with verification.cnameTarget (method ADDRESS: an apex domain has no CNAME and no challenge left). The DNS lookup runs before the write's transaction. A verified clubs-admin domain gets its certificate at once, but Caddy serves the back-office app on it only after the host is added to CLUB_ADMIN_HOSTS and Caddy is reloaded (docs/DEPLOY.md, «Alta d'un domini de club»; choosing the app from the domain is INC-64); until then the host serves the members' app.","operationId":"verifyPlatformDomain","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"host","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"DomainVerification","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainVerification"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"CLUB_NOT_FOUND, NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION, INVALID_STATE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"HOST_NOT_VERIFIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/js